Build libbitcoin-system 3.8.0 (made for Boost <= 1.75) against Boost 1.86 and
secp256k1 0.7:

- Boost.Interprocess dropped detail/posix_time_types_wrk.hpp; include the
  posix_time header it wrapped directly.
- Boost.Log's file::collector interface changed: scan_for_files() now returns
  a scan_result carrying the last counter in use instead of writing the next
  one through a pointer, and is_in_storage() became pure virtual. Both are
  ported from Boost 1.86's own file_collector.
- secp256k1 removed the deprecated secp256k1_ec_privkey_tweak_* aliases; call
  the secp256k1_ec_seckey_tweak_* functions they pointed to.

